<P STYLE="text-align: right; margin: 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>Exhibit 99.1</B></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><IMG SRC="ea029985001_ex99-1img1.jpg" ALT="">&nbsp;</P>

